{"id":"u-0d58e53a-7f5a-4ef8-85b9-ba98919f84f0","src":"community","title":"EZ Gainz (woman)","author":"Shezi","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/KaKAbu-ez-gainz-woman","desc":"Gaining muscle 💪 with minimal time investment.\n\nTips/ explanations: \n\n-Each workout is designed going from lower body (1 exercise for glutes, quads, hamstrings) to upper body and then upper limbs.\n\n- Start each excercise with 1-2 warm up sets in which you use the same rep range and form but with a lot lighter weight than the 3 working sets. \n\n\n- 3x8-10 means you do 3 sets within the rep range of 8-10. If you can't do the minimum rep requirement on each set the weight is too heavy. Once you pass the top end of the rep range for EACH set you must go up in weight. Especially in the lower body heavy sets. You must keep them heavy. So for example hipthrust 3x6-8, if you get 10,9,9 go up.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":155,"rate":5,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-25T01:38:31.321Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Hip Thrust (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9},{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"Do 2 warm up sets first. \n3min rest at least between main sets."},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8},{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9},{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":10}],"note":"Do 2 warm up sets first. \n3min rest at least between main sets."},{"n":"Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"Lying curls\nDo one warm up set at least"},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"Do 1 warm up set first. \n2min rest at least between main sets."},{"n":"Single Arm Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}],"note":"Do a warm up set first. \n2min rest at least between main sets."},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"V-Handle Tricep Pushdo